OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared amid
OL,4,A'extreme pressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident has been declared
OL,7,Fby an NHS trust that runs Nottingham's
OL,8,Ftwo major hospitals due to "some of the
OL,9,Fhighest attendances on record" at its
OL,10,FA&E departments.
OL,12,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)
OL,13,FNHS trust - which runs the Queen's
OL,14,FMedical Centre and Nottingham City
OL,15,FHospital - said patients were "having
OL,16,Funacceptable and lengthy waits on
OL,17,Fcorridors", with staff "under extreme
OL,18,Fpressure".
OL,20,FAccording to NUH, there were more than
OL,21,Fthan 200 patients in A&E, with more
OL,22,Fthan 100 waiting to be seen.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
