OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared amid
OL,4,A'extreme pressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Hall, chief operating office,
OL,7,Fsaid: "In the last 24 hours staff have
OL,8,Fbeen working hard to do everything they
OL,9,Fcan to mitigate the pressures, focusing
OL,10,Fon getting patients seen and home."
